WEBVTT

00:01.060 --> 00:08.820
The history of gaming extends 5,000
years into the past to ancient Egypt.

00:08.820 --> 00:13.200
Ancient games foretold the
futures of men and kings.

00:13.200 --> 00:16.990
They were magic ceremonies that
determined a person's fate.

00:16.990 --> 00:20.450
These ceremonies were known
as the "Shadow Games."

00:20.450 --> 00:22.910
In the present, a young boy
solves the Millenium Puzzle.

00:22.910 --> 00:28.040
He becomes the heir to the Shadow
Games, and the Guardian of Justice.

00:28.040 --> 00:31.760
This boy possesses two hearts:
one of light and one of darkness.

00:31.800 --> 00:33.680
He is known as "Yu-Gi-Oh,"
the King of Games.

01:01.450 --> 01:04.160
"What you can see, yet cannot see."

01:04.160 --> 01:06.170
"That's a puzzle."

01:06.170 --> 01:12.420
You may be able to see it, but since it hasn't been completed yet, you have no clue on what it'll look like!

01:14.130 --> 01:15.880
I'm so close, too!

01:57.760 --> 01:59.760
Oh, now I get it!

02:14.030 --> 02:15.990
It's a perfect fit!

02:16.360 --> 02:19.490
So, then, this one should fit too!

02:22.530 --> 02:24.240
It's done!

02:24.240 --> 02:27.290
Once I put in the last piece, it'll be complete!

02:39.380 --> 02:43.930
"The one who solves me shall
gain the powers and knowledge of darkness," huh?

02:45.140 --> 02:49.640
I'm about to finish the puzzle that
Grandpa told me will make my wishes come true.

02:58.150 --> 03:00.660
And this makes the Millennium Puzzle complete!

03:06.160 --> 03:08.160
I did it! It's all finished!

03:14.460 --> 03:17.510
My soul has been set free...

03:19.260 --> 03:24.970
My name is Anubis.
I shall destroy Pharaoh and I shall give rise to Pharaoh.

03:41.320 --> 03:44.240
O Millennium Puzzle,
please grant my wish.

03:44.950 --> 03:50.790
I want a friend. A best friend with bonds strong
enough to link both of our hearts together...

03:51.460 --> 03:54.580
Who would have guessed
that he'd actually complete it...

03:54.580 --> 03:59.460
But, he who completes the Millennium Puzzle
becomes the ruler of darkness.

03:59.460 --> 04:04.470
I may have unloaded a heavy
fate on my grandson's shoulders.

04:06.470 --> 04:08.640
Did my wish reach you?

04:14.150 --> 04:15.810
W-What...?

04:55.600 --> 04:58.360
Stifle yourselves, demonic beasts!

05:15.870 --> 05:15.870
Huh...?

05:30.510 --> 05:34.350
The King of Darkness is already
back amongst the living...

05:58.830 --> 06:06.550
I shall search for the King of Light, disperse of the
dark with the light and fill this world with light.

06:17.390 --> 06:23.480
YU-GI-OH! DUEL MONSTERS
PYRAMID OF LIGHT

07:24.590 --> 07:30.170
Yugi Muto beat Pegasus at duelist
Kingdom and conquered Battle City.

07:31.880 --> 07:36.930
It says Yugi Muto beat Seto Kaiba
and Marik to become Duel King.

07:43.730 --> 07:47.730
So Yugi Muto now owns
all three God Cards, huh?

08:15.390 --> 08:18.260
No card can surpass the three God Cards!

08:18.260 --> 08:21.060
My turn. Draw!

08:21.060 --> 08:23.810
There can be no new creation without destruction!

08:23.810 --> 08:27.820
Now I will destroy the three
Illusionary Beasts to create new history!

08:27.820 --> 08:28.820
What?!

08:28.820 --> 08:31.400
I activate Polymerization from my hand!

08:39.620 --> 08:41.950
Blue-Eyes Ultimate Dragon!

08:47.130 --> 08:50.920
Plus, the Equip Spell, Heroic
Growth, will double its attack points!

09:01.640 --> 09:04.060
A 9000 attack points monster?!

09:05.140 --> 09:07.520
Now, my Ultimate has surpassed your gods!

09:07.980 --> 09:12.110
Obelisk the Tormentor,
show him your true and ultimate power!

09:12.490 --> 09:12.490
What?!

09:21.120 --> 09:22.290
I-Is this...?!

09:24.160 --> 09:26.420
Soul Energy Max!

09:30.460 --> 09:36.050
By tributing the other two gods,
Obelisk gained unlimited power!

09:37.050 --> 09:39.470
Super Ultimate Burst!

09:40.810 --> 09:43.060
Experience the iron-blow of a god!

09:43.060 --> 09:45.520
God Hand Impact!

10:04.120 --> 10:04.870
What?!

10:15.090 --> 10:16.340
What's this?!

10:16.340 --> 10:18.510
- What happened?!
- What's going on here?!

10:22.300 --> 10:24.850
According to our calculations,
Ultimate's destructive power

10:24.850 --> 10:27.310
should have outclassed the Illusionary Beasts, but...

10:28.350 --> 10:30.810
Please accept our apologies.
The simulation failed.

10:31.400 --> 10:33.570
How very trite...
This is getting absurd.

10:33.570 --> 10:37.320
I believe that in our next simulation
we will be able defeat the Illusionary Beasts...

10:37.700 --> 10:41.780
You fail in your analysis of the God Cards
and you dare spout drivel about simulations?!

10:41.780 --> 10:44.370
Beat it! I don't want your faces in my sight!

10:44.370 --> 10:45.290
Master Kaiba!

10:45.290 --> 10:49.790
Hmph, there was only one thing true
within the farce you all helped create.

10:50.540 --> 10:55.090
And that one thing was that the future
can't be created without destroying the past.

10:55.090 --> 10:57.720
Unless I surpass the God Cards, there will be no future.

11:05.180 --> 11:06.680
Big brother...

11:07.140 --> 11:10.190
At the moment, I don't hold a
candle to the power of Yugi's deck.

11:10.640 --> 11:14.190
There must be a card
that can fill this gap in our powers...

11:59.780 --> 12:01.700
Oh! It's the three Illusionary Beasts...

12:27.850 --> 12:29.930
The same dream again...

12:45.740 --> 12:48.990
What does this all mean?

12:54.790 --> 12:59.630
This is Flight #1. lnitiating duel
Dome Launch Conversion. Over.

13:53.270 --> 13:55.310
Brother, you are all set for take off.

13:55.310 --> 13:57.310
Blue Eyes Jet, taking off!

14:18.420 --> 14:25.840
Giving my Blue-Eyes White Dragon the power to surpass
the lllusionary Beasts... To do so, I must go see that man.

14:58.040 --> 14:59.500
<i>Merci.</i>

15:05.210 --> 15:08.220
Hi, Kaiba-boy. It has been far too long.

15:08.550 --> 15:10.590
I don't need any of your hellos, Pegasus.

15:10.630 --> 15:14.760
You created the three duel cards which
possess the very power of the gods.

15:14.760 --> 15:18.520
However, he who stands at the apex is
destined to be surpassed eventually.

15:18.520 --> 15:20.560
That's just how history has been weaved.

15:20.560 --> 15:27.190
There's no reason why a duelist of your caliber wouldn't prepare a card to surpass the three God Cards.

15:27.400 --> 15:32.660
If that's the matter, then I have nothing to talk about. Now, run along home, Kaiba-boy.

15:32.660 --> 15:34.950
So, it is already complete, isn't it?

15:34.950 --> 15:38.700
Oh, why, no... I've retired from the forefront.

15:39.370 --> 15:45.460
Nature sure is beautiful. Your goal in life
shouldn't merely be to become the Duel King.

15:45.500 --> 15:49.420
Kaiba Corporation's information
network encompasses the entire world.

15:49.420 --> 15:51.300
You can play dumb all you
want, but it'll get you nowhere.

15:55.470 --> 16:00.810
I admit that the card exists.
However, I will not be giving it to you as you are.

16:01.140 --> 16:02.060
What?!

16:02.060 --> 16:08.070
You must have a heart befitting enough to wield power. Power lacking heart will only bring about tragedy.

16:09.820 --> 16:13.530
This is the shape of an individual
swayed by power at his last rope.

16:13.530 --> 16:19.290
Kaiba-boy, your current desire for power
exceeds enormous... and that is very dangerous.

16:19.330 --> 16:22.330
If you're saying that I don't have the heart of a duelist...

16:22.330 --> 16:23.710
...try making sure of it with a duel!

16:24.330 --> 16:26.290
We'll have a duel with the ante rules.

16:26.290 --> 16:30.340
I'll ante up these three cards here.
The cards that are a part my very life.

16:30.340 --> 16:32.800
Ah... the three Blue-Eyes...

16:32.800 --> 16:36.350
Kaiba-boy, you are prepared to go such great lengths?

16:36.350 --> 16:39.970
Very well, then... I accept your
duel using the ante rules.

16:40.680 --> 16:43.520
Allow me to make you realize

16:43.520 --> 16:48.110
that the difference in our powers hasn't changed at all since Duelist Kingdom!

16:51.650 --> 16:54.700
We shall use this ring for the duel.

16:54.700 --> 16:57.990
This system is pretty dated, but it'll do.

17:00.990 --> 17:05.620
The card is in this case.
Defeat me and you can take it.

17:05.620 --> 17:08.130
Hmph, that goes without saying.

17:10.630 --> 17:10.630
Duel!

17:10.630 --> 17:13.880
It's my turn! Draw!

17:14.470 --> 17:20.180
Allow me to make you remember...
the terror of our match at duelist Kingdom.

17:20.180 --> 17:24.600
I pay 1,000 of my life points to
activate a spell card from my hand!

17:25.560 --> 17:26.770
Toon World!

17:33.360 --> 17:38.370
Heh... You're stuck in the past and haven't
made any progress, just like this old duel Ring.

17:39.160 --> 17:41.870
Now I'm positive our match is already over...

17:43.000 --> 17:46.330
I summon Toon Gemini Elf
in attack position.

17:53.050 --> 17:57.720
Then, I set a card
to put an end to my turn.

17:57.970 --> 17:59.220
It's my turn.

18:02.930 --> 18:05.430
I summon X-Head Cannon!

18:08.440 --> 18:10.520
Then, I set two cards...

18:12.230 --> 18:13.530
...and that ends my turn.

18:14.070 --> 18:20.820
That a duelist of your skills would make
such empty boasts is simply unbelievable.

18:20.870 --> 18:24.410
"This match is already over." That's what you say.

18:26.000 --> 18:29.080
I will make you regret ever angering me!

18:29.080 --> 18:31.590
Enough of your tripe! Get on with the duel!

18:32.000 --> 18:34.460
It's my turn. I draw.

18:34.460 --> 18:38.130
I activate Card of Sanctity.

18:39.470 --> 18:44.560
Both players will draw until their hands hold six cards.

18:48.850 --> 18:51.940
I activate a spell card from my hand! Cost Down!

18:51.940 --> 18:52.860
This card will...

18:52.860 --> 18:53.940
No need to explain!

18:54.940 --> 18:59.860
It's a card that reduces the Level of a monster in
your hand by two by discarding a card in your hand.

18:59.860 --> 19:02.280
And you're using it for Toon Dark Magician Girl.

19:02.660 --> 19:05.040
That's right!

19:05.040 --> 19:08.790
A new page of Toons will open!

19:12.130 --> 19:13.960
We battle, Kaiba-boy!

19:13.960 --> 19:16.340
I attack with Toon Gemini Elf!

19:21.760 --> 19:23.470
Gemini!

19:23.470 --> 19:24.140
What?!

19:30.560 --> 19:35.150
His Toons don't care about my monsters and will come setting their sights directly towards me, the player.

19:35.150 --> 19:40.280
But, that isn't all. Toon Gemini Elf has a special ability.

19:41.450 --> 19:47.120
When they deal damage on the player,
they'll randomly discard one card in their hand.

19:50.540 --> 19:54.500
Great! My Toons are truly great!

19:56.880 --> 19:59.510
Toons, the invincible lifeforms...

19:59.510 --> 20:03.220
Toon monsters cannot be defended
against unless you have a Toon.

20:03.220 --> 20:05.470
Your bluffs end here!

20:05.470 --> 20:09.890
Toon Dark Magician Girl, give
Kaiba-boy there his lumps!

20:13.100 --> 20:15.270
I see you underestimated me.

20:15.270 --> 20:19.940
Seto Kaiba will never take on a direct attack twice!

20:20.360 --> 20:22.700
I activate my trap card,
Attack Guidance Armor!

20:23.610 --> 20:24.820
Oh, no!

20:25.620 --> 20:31.620
Attack Guidance Armor guides an attack toward
the equipped monster and forces a battle.

20:31.620 --> 20:33.830
You're after...

20:33.830 --> 20:36.540
Your two Toons can monkey
around with each other now!

20:36.540 --> 20:40.210
I equip Attack Guidance Armor to Toon Gemini Elf!

20:57.110 --> 20:58.520
Take this!

21:02.610 --> 21:04.990
No! My Toons...!

21:05.660 --> 21:07.990
You are going to pay for that one, Kaiba-boy.

21:07.990 --> 21:10.540
I activate the spell card,
Monster Reborn.

21:15.960 --> 21:18.500
Next, I activate Ultimate Offering.

21:18.500 --> 21:24.130
I reduce my life points by 500 to summon another monster for a Normal Summoning!

21:24.130 --> 21:29.850
I tribute Toon Gemini Elf
to summon Blue-Eyes Toon Dragon!

21:37.230 --> 21:43.650
And, of course, its Level is eight, but Cost Down's effect treats it as a Level six monster,

21:43.650 --> 21:46.610
so a single tribute will suffice.

21:46.610 --> 21:49.490
Then, I summon Toon Summoned Skull.

21:49.740 --> 21:51.870
I don't even have to explain, but...

21:51.990 --> 21:56.210
Cost Down's effect turns my Level
six monster into a Level four,

21:56.210 --> 21:58.710
so it doesn't require
any tributes for its summoning.

21:59.290 --> 22:03.840
My Toons are in full force! This match is set!

22:03.840 --> 22:08.840
Do you get it now?
I'm going to let you keep your precious Blue-Eyes,

22:08.840 --> 22:11.890
so pack up your cards and scurry on home!

22:11.930 --> 22:14.810
Nonsense. This duel isn't over yet.

22:14.810 --> 22:19.560
Unbelievable! Kaiba-boy isn't the least bit worried
when faced with a situation like this?

22:21.570 --> 22:25.070
Kaiba-boy, you no longer have a chance of winning this!

22:25.070 --> 22:29.490
Unprogressing cretin, a duelist is someone
who strives forward while looking at the future.

22:29.490 --> 22:32.410
Adhering to your past glories
is the epitome of foolishness.

22:32.410 --> 22:33.120
What?!

22:33.120 --> 22:38.120
Dueling is an art created by the imaginations
of duelists with their gazes on the future!

22:38.120 --> 22:43.420
People who use their past tactics as a crutch
don't even deserve to call themselves duelists!

22:43.420 --> 22:46.670
How dare you approach me, the
creator of Duel Monsters, like that!

22:46.670 --> 22:49.550
I'm going to show you dueling
that transcends common logic!

22:49.550 --> 22:51.050
My turn! Draw!

22:52.140 --> 22:55.560
I activate a spell card
from my hand! Dark Core!

23:00.980 --> 23:02.400
Dark Core...

23:02.400 --> 23:07.400
That card removes one monster on the field from
the game by discarding one card in your hand.

23:07.400 --> 23:09.030
And Kaiba-boy is after...

23:09.780 --> 23:11.490
...the one with the highest attack power...

23:11.490 --> 23:16.040
No... the monster that Kaiba
boy adores the most, Blue-Eyes!

23:16.040 --> 23:20.170
You idiot, that would be
bound by common sense!

23:20.170 --> 23:26.090
I send Y-Dragon Head from my hand to the graveyard to remove my X-Head Cannon from the game!

23:27.130 --> 23:31.430
What are you scheming by removing
your own monster from the game?!

23:31.720 --> 23:34.680
Next is the spell card, Soul Release...

23:34.680 --> 23:39.640
This card's effect removes
Y-Dragon Head from the game.

23:39.640 --> 23:41.650
Removing your X and Y monsters...?!

23:41.650 --> 23:45.900
Then, I summon a monster!
Z-Metal Tank!

23:48.530 --> 23:50.120
And now it's Z...

23:50.120 --> 23:50.780
It couldn't be...

23:50.780 --> 23:53.990
Destroy the past and the future will be created.

23:54.280 --> 23:59.080
To someone who dwells in the past, the future
must look like a continuing impossibility...

23:59.080 --> 24:03.500
I pay half of my life to activate
Return from the Different Dimension off of my field!

24:03.500 --> 24:05.340
Return from the Different Dimension!

24:05.340 --> 24:08.840
It's a card that Special Summons as
many monsters removed from the game

24:09.210 --> 24:13.180
to your side of the field as possible in attack position.

24:14.390 --> 24:16.850
XYZ-Combination!

24:16.850 --> 24:19.140
Show yourself, XYZ-Dragon Cannon!

24:35.450 --> 24:40.620
This monster destroys one of your
cards by discarding a card in my hand.

24:40.620 --> 24:45.330
Destroy his Toon World, XYZ-Dragon Cannon!

24:47.000 --> 24:48.170
Oh no!

24:48.170 --> 24:50.050
Hyper Destruction!

25:04.560 --> 25:05.900
Now for the ante rules.

25:10.650 --> 25:14.400
You were right. I'll be taking both of these cards.

25:14.740 --> 25:17.370
<i>Both</i> cards...? That's not...

25:18.740 --> 25:20.830
Wait a minute, Kaiba-boy!

25:28.540 --> 25:31.050
Today's another slow day, it seems.

25:33.510 --> 25:37.550
"Mummy Exhibit at the Domino Museum," huh?

25:37.970 --> 25:38.760
Is this...?!

25:39.680 --> 25:44.680
So, at last... So, at last, it's been found...

25:52.360 --> 25:53.530
What's up with that?

25:53.530 --> 25:55.070
Wonder if something happened.

26:01.830 --> 26:04.540
W-What's up? This sure is impressive.

26:04.540 --> 26:06.250
What's "impressive?!"

26:10.500 --> 26:12.960
It's Yugi Muto, the Duel King!

26:14.800 --> 26:17.340
I've been waiting for you!
Please accept my challenge!

26:17.590 --> 26:22.600
Champion! We're having a duel with
the ante rules and the three God Cards at stake!

26:22.720 --> 26:24.770
With me! With me! With me!

26:25.140 --> 26:26.230
What is all this?!

26:26.230 --> 26:32.360
Word of him becoming champion in Battle City and gaining the God Cards spread across the entire world!

26:32.730 --> 26:34.860
Yugi! You slip out the back gate!

26:34.860 --> 26:35.900
B-But!

26:35.900 --> 26:36.690
Yugi, hurry!

26:36.690 --> 26:38.860
I'll handle things here!

26:38.860 --> 26:39.660
Jonouchi!

26:39.700 --> 26:42.160
Play against this many people and you'll
be dead by the time you finish!

26:42.830 --> 26:43.620
Wait a sec!

26:46.790 --> 26:48.080
Counting on you, Honda.

26:48.080 --> 26:49.460
Sure, leave it to me.

26:55.670 --> 26:58.130
- Hold it, hold it, hold it!
- Hold it, dammit!

26:58.130 --> 27:00.140
Why is the Duel King running away?

27:00.140 --> 27:02.680
Is the Champion, Yugi Muto,
chicken, or somethin'?

27:02.680 --> 27:04.970
So, running out while he's ahead
with the God Cards, is he?

27:05.270 --> 27:09.480
What are you jerks talking about?!
Yugi ain't a coward!

27:09.480 --> 27:12.360
Then why won't he fight us fair and square?!

27:12.400 --> 27:13.480
Yeah! Yeah!

27:13.480 --> 27:18.190
The Illusionary Beast cards that Pegasus
created aren't just Yugi Muto's!

27:18.190 --> 27:19.820
They're the treasure of the entire world!

27:19.820 --> 27:22.410
Huh? What crap are you spouting now?

27:22.410 --> 27:27.080
Ah, I gotcha, I gotcha! In that case, yours truly is gonna give you all a little test!

27:27.080 --> 27:28.330
Hey, Jonouchi...

27:28.330 --> 27:31.750
The one and only Katsuya Jonouchi, the guy
who made it into Battle City's Top Four,

27:31.750 --> 27:36.210
is going to test whether or not you guys
have what it takes to challenge Yugi!

27:46.470 --> 27:48.560
Well? Any takers?

27:49.480 --> 27:52.230
All right, then. I'll take your challenge!

27:55.820 --> 27:57.230
Card, draw!

27:58.780 --> 28:00.740
I summon Injection Fairy Lily!

28:05.120 --> 28:06.200
Hi!

28:07.660 --> 28:11.710
I pay 2000 life points to increase
her attack points by 3000!

28:15.540 --> 28:18.630
Go, Lily! Check-Up Time!

28:18.630 --> 28:20.720
Here's your shot! A-one and a-two!

28:21.800 --> 28:23.430
A direct attack already?!

28:29.470 --> 28:34.480
I tribute Fenrir and Inpachi to
summon Maju Garzett!

28:37.940 --> 28:40.900
Go, Garzett! Maju Toxic Attack!

28:48.120 --> 28:51.080
Let me show you the strength
of one of the Battle City Top Four!

28:51.120 --> 28:52.250
It's my turn!

28:52.790 --> 28:53.750
Here we are!

28:53.750 --> 28:58.170
I tribute Baby Dragon, Rocket
Warrior, and Little-Winguard!

28:59.340 --> 29:01.510
To summon Gilford the Lightning!

29:02.970 --> 29:08.050
If you summon Gilford the Lightning
by sacrificing three monsters,

29:08.050 --> 29:10.970
it'll destroy all monsters on the
opponent's side of the field!

29:10.970 --> 29:12.810
Lightning Thunder!

29:21.150 --> 29:25.280
Gilford the Lightning attacks directly!
Lightning Crash Sword!

29:37.420 --> 29:43.920
All right! Anybody who can't even beat ol' Top Four
me shouldn't be prattling about any God Cards!

29:44.340 --> 29:45.800
Incredible, Jonouchi!

29:45.800 --> 29:48.550
Hey, Yugi Muto's right over there!

29:48.550 --> 29:50.720
They found us! We can't stick around, Yugi!

29:50.970 --> 29:52.060
Yugi's run away!

29:52.060 --> 29:52.850
That way!

30:07.070 --> 30:08.570
Yugi, this way!

30:10.910 --> 30:11.740
Where'd he go?

30:11.740 --> 30:13.120
Thought he came this way...

30:13.120 --> 30:15.290
Crap! We lost sight of him!

30:33.220 --> 30:34.640
What is that?

30:37.390 --> 30:39.940
It's a dead-ringer for your pendant, Yugi.

30:39.940 --> 30:40.940
Mm-hmm.

30:40.940 --> 30:43.360
It's a crystal one, though. Sure is pretty.

30:55.200 --> 30:58.120
This is making me sick...
Let's hurry to the next one!

30:58.540 --> 31:02.130
Mm-hmm. Looks like that Crystal
Pyramid's exhibit is on the other side.

31:12.930 --> 31:14.560
Grandpa! Why are you here?

31:14.810 --> 31:17.180
Oh, Yugi. So, you're here?

31:17.810 --> 31:17.810
Take a look at this.

31:19.980 --> 31:20.850
This?

31:20.850 --> 31:21.600
Mm-hm.

31:22.770 --> 31:27.150
It's the same as Yugi's Millennium
Puzzle, but it's upside down, isn't it?

31:27.150 --> 31:32.160
No, if you look at the Ancient Egyptian lettering,
the hieroglyphs, you'll see that it's correct.

31:32.160 --> 31:37.540
It's a legendary treasure said to
exist long ago yet never discovered.

31:37.750 --> 31:41.500
What's the deal? Could it be
connected to the Millennium Puzzle?

31:41.500 --> 31:46.170
This crystal pyramid is called the Pyramid of Light, and symbolizes the King of Light.

31:46.460 --> 31:50.630
So, in other words, it exists in direct
opposition to your Millennium Puzzle.

31:51.180 --> 31:54.470
There was something written on the
lid of the sarcophagus across from here.

31:54.470 --> 31:55.640
Let's go back, then.

31:55.640 --> 31:58.100
Oh, no! You mean back to that mummy again?!

31:59.520 --> 32:00.890
Just as creepy as when we left it...

32:00.890 --> 32:03.230
What's this written here?

32:03.730 --> 32:08.360
"When the King of Light and the King of Darkness
fight, the King of Destruction will then be reborn"...

32:08.360 --> 32:10.450
...or some meaning along those lines is written here.

32:11.070 --> 32:14.240
This hieratic text is almost like a tome of prophecy.

32:21.330 --> 32:23.040
W-What the?!

32:26.290 --> 32:27.500
What's this?

32:30.420 --> 32:32.800
When both light and dark intersect,

32:32.840 --> 32:37.930
the King of Light will destroy the Divine Beasts of
Darkness and lay waste to the King of Darkness.

32:38.390 --> 32:40.180
When enough light is fulfilled...

32:40.180 --> 32:42.440
the King of Destruction will reborn!

32:48.070 --> 32:49.650
Yugi! Yugi!

32:52.240 --> 32:54.700
Did you have the same vision, Anzu?

32:54.700 --> 32:55.740
What did you say?

32:55.740 --> 32:59.080
The whole place filled with light and
blinded us. Anyway, look at that.

33:02.040 --> 33:04.330
The contents of the sarcophagus... The mummy is gone!

33:04.830 --> 33:07.710
Hey! Same over here! The Crystal Pyramid is gone too!

33:09.960 --> 33:13.170
Thank goodness.
Anzu, take care of Grandpa for me!

33:13.170 --> 33:14.470
Yugi! Where are you going?!

33:15.130 --> 33:16.590
There's something that's bugging me.

33:17.220 --> 33:18.010
Wait, Yugi!

33:18.760 --> 33:21.220
What happened? W-What's this?

33:21.220 --> 33:22.730
Gramps, are you okay?

33:22.730 --> 33:24.890
W-What happened?!

33:24.940 --> 33:28.060
The mummy and the Pyramid of Light disappeared.

33:28.110 --> 33:30.820
Don't tell me that ancient mummy was resurrected!

33:31.320 --> 33:35.910
However, the sarcophagus' prophecy did tell
of the resurrection of the King of Destruction...

33:37.370 --> 33:38.200
Yugi?

33:38.200 --> 33:40.200
He rushed off somewhere.

33:40.200 --> 33:45.830
Could Yugi have had the same vision as me?
Something could already be making its move...

33:54.470 --> 33:57.300
Yugi, this is a message
from my brother.

33:57.300 --> 34:01.930
He says he's waiting at Kaiba Land and for you to make sure to come with the God Cards in your deck.

34:03.020 --> 34:03.810
What's going on here?

34:04.480 --> 34:06.020
I don't know.

34:06.020 --> 34:09.360
It's almost as if my big brother is possessed
by something and acting weird...

34:12.610 --> 34:15.280
Wonder if Yugi managed to get away...

34:15.280 --> 34:19.280
Am I ever tired or what. Though, there wasn't
really anyone to make a big fuss over, you know.

34:19.280 --> 34:22.160
Liar. There was plenty to make a fuss over.

34:25.250 --> 34:26.790
Huh? That car...

34:32.300 --> 34:34.590
Where's Yugi going?

34:34.590 --> 34:36.300
That's the way to Kaiba Land!

34:52.480 --> 34:54.780
My brother should be waiting for you in the dome.

34:54.780 --> 34:55.820
Uh-huh.

35:16.010 --> 35:18.420
My other self...

35:21.720 --> 35:25.850
I intended to never use these three cards to duel.

35:25.850 --> 35:28.890
But, it seems like something's happening to Kaiba.

35:28.890 --> 35:33.900
If things turn out like in the prophecy,
I'll lose this duel and Kaiba will win.

35:34.570 --> 35:36.530
As a result, Kaiba will be in danger as well!

35:36.570 --> 35:41.070
If there are dark forces at work,
then you ought to quit this duel.

35:41.070 --> 35:43.240
But, Kaiba probably wouldn't listen.

35:44.280 --> 35:47.160
Once the duel starts,
we'll have no idea what'll happen.

35:47.160 --> 35:50.080
We have one option. We have to fight and win.

35:50.370 --> 35:53.630
With our combined powers, we can change the future that's been prophesied, right?

35:53.630 --> 35:54.090
Right.

36:02.760 --> 36:06.010
Hey, did Yugi really come here?

36:06.010 --> 36:09.730
I'm sure the car Yugi was in was
heading the way to Kaiba Land!

36:09.730 --> 36:11.270
If it's Yugi you're after, he's inside here.

36:11.770 --> 36:13.020
Why did he come here?

36:13.520 --> 36:15.150
To duel with my brother.

36:45.050 --> 36:46.550
So, you arrived.

37:10.240 --> 37:11.160
- Yugi!
- Yugi!

37:23.720 --> 37:26.300
So good of you to come, Yugi.
I must commend you.

37:26.300 --> 37:28.760
I'm taking the Duel King title back from you.

37:28.760 --> 37:33.890
Wait, dark forces are at work on this duel.
Even so, you're still committed to this?

37:33.890 --> 37:36.150
More of your occult tales?

37:38.310 --> 37:40.190
Enough is enough!

37:40.190 --> 37:43.240
You brought the three God Cards with you, right?

37:43.240 --> 37:48.240
I only want to prove that I've outdone you
with the three God Cards in your possession.

37:48.570 --> 37:50.450
Mokuba, seal all exits!

37:50.450 --> 37:52.410
Yes, big brother.

37:58.330 --> 37:59.590
What is this?

37:59.590 --> 38:00.590
What's going on?

38:00.960 --> 38:03.090
You can't run, even if you try, Yugi.

38:03.590 --> 38:06.800
So Kaiba isn't aware of anything after all.

38:06.840 --> 38:11.310
Yeah. And we might be able to nab
the true identity of the evil during this duel.

38:11.310 --> 38:12.100
I'll take you on, then!

38:12.600 --> 38:17.230
Your deck already holds your response. You <i>do</i> have the three God Cards in there, don't you?

38:17.230 --> 38:18.230
I do.

38:19.020 --> 38:21.860
Both of us will set our shuffled
decks into our duel Disks.

38:24.990 --> 38:28.950
Life points are at 4000. Counters, set.

38:28.950 --> 38:31.490
For crying out loud, that damn Kaiba sure is persistent.

38:31.530 --> 38:32.950
What in the heck is he cooking up?

38:33.700 --> 38:37.410
Brother's got himself a card
that'll defeat the gods.

38:37.410 --> 38:39.250
He's sure to win this time.

38:39.250 --> 38:42.840
It's been the same outcome in my duels with you
more times than I can count.

38:42.840 --> 38:45.010
But, this will be the end.

38:45.010 --> 38:47.470
Because when everything is said and done,

38:47.470 --> 38:52.350
you'll be completely drained and
never be able to handle a card again!

38:53.060 --> 38:53.890
Duel!

38:54.520 --> 38:55.220
Draw!

38:55.600 --> 38:58.020
Deck Destruction Virus...

39:01.060 --> 39:04.530
I summon Familiar Knight from
my hand in defense position.

39:04.530 --> 39:05.480
I end my turn.

39:06.070 --> 39:08.950
It's my turn! Draw!

39:12.950 --> 39:14.620
I summon Queen's Knight!

39:17.290 --> 39:18.080
Battle!

39:23.090 --> 39:26.210
Queen's Saber Clash!

39:31.640 --> 39:39.100
When Familiar Knight is destroyed in battle, both players can summon a Level Four monster in their hand.

39:39.100 --> 39:44.900
Huh?! Level Four and 2400?! It has the same attack points as Red-Eyes and Jinzo!

39:44.900 --> 39:45.940
What? That's insane!

39:45.940 --> 39:50.860
Rare Metal Dragon, the strongest of all Level
Fours, can't be Normal Summoned.

39:51.320 --> 39:55.580
Yes, that's right. Everything was a part
of my plan to summon Rare Metal Dragon.

39:55.990 --> 39:58.330
I see now. Not bad, Kaiba.

39:58.330 --> 40:00.000
What's so funny?

40:00.000 --> 40:03.500
If that's the case, allow me to
use your combo for myself!

40:03.880 --> 40:06.710
Special Summon! King's Knight!

40:07.920 --> 40:13.640
When the King and the Queen are on the field,
they can Special Summon the Jack from my deck!

40:13.640 --> 40:15.890
The Three Musketeers of Face Cards are summoned!

40:15.890 --> 40:18.390
Now all I have to do is call forth a God Card...

40:18.890 --> 40:23.150
And then, I set a card and end my turn.

40:23.150 --> 40:26.770
I'm also pleased at the fact that you were
able to gather tributes for your gods

40:26.770 --> 40:29.440
so quickly with your monster combo...

40:31.200 --> 40:33.490
But that's all part of my plan.

40:34.870 --> 40:36.080
Draw!

40:37.530 --> 40:40.330
Yugi, hurry up and call forth your god!

40:40.330 --> 40:42.370
I set this card and end my turn!

40:44.580 --> 40:50.630
He summoned a 2400 attack points monster,
so why didn't he come over and attack me?

40:50.630 --> 40:52.800
Is he being cautious over my face-down card?

40:54.840 --> 40:57.760
Here it is. I feel it.

40:58.470 --> 41:01.180
It's finally here, right, my other self?

41:02.890 --> 41:08.400
I offer my three knights as tributes
to summon Slifer the Sky Dragon!

41:18.120 --> 41:20.660
I've awaited you, god!

41:27.040 --> 41:31.630
I don't know what you placed
face-down, but traps won't affect a god!

41:31.630 --> 41:33.050
Slifer attacks!

41:33.420 --> 41:35.130
Thunder Force!

41:41.560 --> 41:43.560
Turn end!

41:43.560 --> 41:44.350
Draw!

41:46.020 --> 41:49.690
Yugi, I'm going to drag all your gods out onto the field!

41:49.690 --> 41:51.820
Spell card, Obligatory Summon!

41:52.280 --> 41:53.570
Did he say Obligatory Summon?!

41:53.570 --> 41:58.530
Obligatory Summon forces you to Special
Summon monsters with the same type

41:58.570 --> 42:02.450
as a monster in your control from your deck to the field.

42:02.450 --> 42:05.790
Kaiba... What in the world could you be thinking?

42:05.790 --> 42:09.920
Having you gather all three gods together on purpose... What could Kaiba be trying to do?

42:10.750 --> 42:14.050
With monsters of the same type, he's basically telling him to call forth the gods, right?

42:14.050 --> 42:18.840
That Kaiba sure is stupid. Now Yugi has his win in the bag. Don't you think?

42:18.840 --> 42:22.560
I can't be as simplemindedly ecstatic as you are.

42:22.560 --> 42:24.220
Who's mind you callin' simple?!

42:24.220 --> 42:27.060
This is Kaiba we're talking about.
No doubt he has something in store.

42:27.060 --> 42:30.110
Now, let your three gods descend forth.

42:30.150 --> 42:31.820
I'll surpass them!

42:31.820 --> 42:35.610
Impossible! There's no card that can surpass the gods!

42:35.610 --> 42:39.780
Obelisk the Tormentor,
and The Winged Dragon of Ra!

43:10.730 --> 43:15.860
Quite the magnificent sight, Yugi.
However, this is the beginning of your defeat.

43:15.860 --> 43:17.860
Now that the three Illusionary
Beasts are all present on the field,

43:17.860 --> 43:20.910
I'll activate the god-sealing Pyramid of Light!

43:20.910 --> 43:24.490
God-sealing? Is that possible?

43:28.540 --> 43:32.080
So, what was on that tablet was alluding to this?

43:32.630 --> 43:35.960
All gods on the field will be removed from the game.

43:39.170 --> 43:41.050
Be gone off the face of this dimension!

44:11.170 --> 44:12.210
What?!

44:25.050 --> 44:26.810
W-What is this?

44:35.440 --> 44:36.820
The Illusionary Beasts...

44:39.320 --> 44:41.780
A-Awesome, big brother!

44:42.740 --> 44:44.280
What is that?

44:47.580 --> 44:47.580
Partner!

44:49.790 --> 44:51.870
My other self!

44:52.080 --> 44:54.580
Partner! Partner!

44:56.920 --> 44:58.210
What the?!

44:59.420 --> 45:02.470
The Illusionary Beasts were wiped out,
like they were totally helpless.

45:04.970 --> 45:06.600
Wh-What's the deal?!

45:08.260 --> 45:10.220
Grab ahold of the railing, Honda!

45:10.220 --> 45:11.520
Don't have to tell me twice!

45:17.400 --> 45:18.190
The heck?

45:26.280 --> 45:28.030
W-What is this?

45:49.890 --> 45:51.270
What's that light?

45:51.270 --> 45:52.470
We're too late.

45:52.680 --> 45:56.020
That's the light that burned down Ancient Egypt.

45:56.020 --> 46:02.820
Light isn't always righteous light. That radiance's
purpose is to create an even deeper darkness.

46:04.030 --> 46:05.780
Partner! Please answer me!

46:05.780 --> 46:10.450
I can't hear your voice. The
Millennium Puzzle won't respond!

46:10.950 --> 46:13.200
What is going on here?!

46:14.710 --> 46:17.460
The Pyramid of Light's effect
wiped out the gods, for one.

46:31.010 --> 46:34.310
Where am I? What happened to me?

46:34.310 --> 46:37.350
Other self! Can you hear me?!

46:43.860 --> 46:48.320
Where am I? This isn't the mind labyrinth
that's usually inside the Millennium Puzzle.

46:48.360 --> 46:50.490
I've never even seen some of this landscape.

46:50.490 --> 46:53.290
My other self's room is gone.

46:58.710 --> 47:01.080
What? What just happened, Jonouchi?

47:04.300 --> 47:05.550
The heck is this?!

47:06.300 --> 47:07.510
Is this all for real?

47:07.510 --> 47:10.680
Yeah, since the ceiling is the
floor and the floor is the ceiling...

47:10.680 --> 47:12.800
...where exactly are we standing?

47:13.100 --> 47:14.640
Other self!

47:20.400 --> 47:23.440
No way! There's no way!

47:31.240 --> 47:35.490
Other self! Other self!

47:36.120 --> 47:37.040
That voice...

47:37.410 --> 47:39.830
Yeah, no doubt about it.
That's Yugi's voice!

47:39.830 --> 47:40.960
Let's go!

47:50.720 --> 47:54.150
Partner, what in the world happened?

47:55.760 --> 47:57.850
Are you that shocked that your gods are gone?

47:58.230 --> 48:03.310
But, my turn's not yet over.
I'll continue dueling towards my victory!

48:03.310 --> 48:08.860
I activate Mystical Space Typhoon!
It destroys one spell or trap card on the field!

48:10.070 --> 48:12.360
My Mirror Force...!

48:12.610 --> 48:15.490
I summon Peten the Dark Clown from my hand!

48:17.330 --> 48:20.000
Peten, attack Yugi directly!

48:33.220 --> 48:38.060
What? When my life points decreased,
I took both damage and pain...

48:38.270 --> 48:42.060
Then, I set a card and end my turn.

48:42.060 --> 48:43.650
Draw!

48:44.150 --> 48:47.980
I summon Magician's Valkyria! Now we battle, Kaiba!

48:47.980 --> 48:50.240
Magic Illusion!

48:59.660 --> 49:03.080
What's this pain all about? Nevertheless, it's nothing!

49:03.080 --> 49:04.880
That didn't hurt me in the slightest!

49:04.880 --> 49:06.210
Reverse card, open!

49:06.210 --> 49:09.920
The permanent trap,
Deck Destruction Virus!

49:10.300 --> 49:11.050
What?!

49:11.260 --> 49:16.640
It activates when a Dark Attribute monster with
500 or less attack points is destroyed by battle.

49:16.640 --> 49:20.430
It'll randomly send ten cards from my
opponent's deck to the graveyard.

49:20.810 --> 49:21.930
Ten of them?

49:22.310 --> 49:26.900
This is my evolved virus combo.
Your life will shorten with each passing second!

49:36.320 --> 49:38.240
Next, a special ability activates!

49:38.240 --> 49:41.120
I remove the Peten sent to my graveyard from the game

49:41.120 --> 49:45.330
to Special Summon a Peten the
Dark Clown from my hand or deck...

49:45.330 --> 49:47.050
and place it in defense position on the field.

49:52.130 --> 49:53.590
I end my turn.

49:53.590 --> 49:55.380
It's my turn. Draw!

49:56.930 --> 49:58.680
My draws are on the mark.

49:59.100 --> 50:02.140
I Summon Des Feral Imp!

50:02.140 --> 50:05.890
Next, I'll activate the spell card,
Card of Demise!

50:05.890 --> 50:09.150
This card lets me draw until my hand holds five cards.

50:09.360 --> 50:12.780
After five turns, it sends my
entire hand to the graveyard.

50:12.780 --> 50:17.780
Using Des Feral Imp as a tribute, I activate
the ritual spell, White Dragon Ritual!

50:17.780 --> 50:21.540
I Ritual Summon Paladin of White Dragon!

50:21.540 --> 50:26.670
Battle! Paladin of White Dragon, Darkout Sacred Spear!

50:35.590 --> 50:38.680
What's with this pain I felt before?

50:38.680 --> 50:43.220
Almost like my very life-force is getting sucked
from me whenever my life points get reduced...

50:43.220 --> 50:49.570
Then, I offer my Paladin as tribute to Special Summon the Blue-Eyes White Dragon from my deck!

50:53.070 --> 50:57.330
My Blue-Eyes White Dragon can't
attack in the turn it's summoned.

50:59.070 --> 51:01.580
I set a card and end my turn on that.

51:15.840 --> 51:18.090
That's... my other self!

51:30.520 --> 51:32.190
This door...

51:37.150 --> 51:38.410
What's this place...?

51:46.200 --> 51:47.880
What's that sound?

52:16.230 --> 52:17.730
Yugi, where are you?!

52:17.730 --> 52:19.240
Answer!

52:21.490 --> 52:22.490
Yugi!

52:22.490 --> 52:23.740
Yugi!

52:23.740 --> 52:27.240
Jonouchi, Honda, run! The mummies!

52:27.240 --> 52:28.590
Mummies?

52:47.350 --> 52:48.270
It's unbelievable.

52:50.430 --> 52:52.060
Mokuba, what is this?

52:52.440 --> 52:57.980
Dunno. Even with Kaiba Corporation's technology,
you couldn't make something like this.

52:58.820 --> 53:00.190
Yugi...

53:08.450 --> 53:09.540
Yugi!

53:09.540 --> 53:10.290
What's wrong?

53:10.290 --> 53:12.660
I can see Yugi inside the pyramid!

53:12.660 --> 53:13.760
What?!

53:13.870 --> 53:14.960
Gramps?

53:14.960 --> 53:17.180
Yugi might be in grave danger.

53:18.340 --> 53:21.170
The prophecy said that when the King
of Light defeats the King of Darkness

53:21.170 --> 53:24.880
and enough light is fulfilled, the
King of Destruction will revive.

53:24.880 --> 53:27.720
This pyramid filled with light fits that perfectly.

53:27.720 --> 53:29.190
No way...

53:31.640 --> 53:37.440
Brother's going to win on his own.
He doesn't believe in those pseudo-occult tales.

53:37.440 --> 53:41.610
Believe it or not, there's light being filled
to the brim before our very eyes.

53:41.610 --> 53:46.360
We have to stop this duel before Yugi...
no... even Kaiba are placed in harm's way!

53:46.360 --> 53:47.990
No way. You mean Brother would be...

53:48.530 --> 53:49.700
Big brother!

53:49.700 --> 53:51.040
Yugi!

53:53.200 --> 53:56.580
I activate the spell card, Premature Burial!

53:56.580 --> 54:01.130
I pay 800 life points to Special Summon
Magician's Valkyria from my graveyard!

54:01.130 --> 54:02.960
And I equip it with Mage Power.

54:05.720 --> 54:10.470
Mage Power increases the
attack and defense points of a monster

54:10.470 --> 54:13.680
by 500 for each card in
your own Spell/Trap Zones.

54:14.060 --> 54:18.690
I have two cards on my field right now,
so that's a 1000 point increase!

54:19.440 --> 54:24.440
Next, by setting two more cards, its
attack points go up by 1000!

54:24.820 --> 54:30.910
Here goes! Not even Blue-Eyes can withstand the
power of my powered-up Magician's Valkyria!

54:30.910 --> 54:33.000
Magic Illusion!

54:37.580 --> 54:41.000
I activate the trap card,
Attack Guidance Armor!

54:41.000 --> 54:45.520
Your attack will be guided towards the monster
equipped with this cursed armor!

54:46.880 --> 54:47.880
Oh no!

54:53.560 --> 54:58.940
And you haven't forgotten that Deck Destruction Virus is a permanent trap, have you?

55:00.440 --> 55:04.080
It randomly sends another ten cards
from your deck to the graveyard!

55:06.990 --> 55:10.410
A good half of my cards have already been lost.

55:10.410 --> 55:12.410
Looking pretty pathetic there, Yugi.

55:12.410 --> 55:18.370
The special effect of the Peten sent to the graveyard will Special Summon another Peten from my deck!

55:20.790 --> 55:26.010
Déjà vu, isn't it? Your turn was just a
bunch of futile resistance, in the end.

55:26.010 --> 55:27.390
I end my turn.

55:27.510 --> 55:32.800
What a terribly well-thought out deck.
I have to do something about that combo of his.

55:32.800 --> 55:36.020
So, you're all here, my dragons.

55:36.390 --> 55:38.980
I activate the spell card, Polymerization!

55:38.980 --> 55:42.770
It'll fuse the Blue-Eyes on the field
with the two Blue-Eyes in my hand!

55:43.770 --> 55:47.410
Arise, Blue-Eyes Ultimate Dragon!

55:52.780 --> 55:55.290
The mightiest monster that Kaiba has...

55:55.660 --> 55:59.290
An ultimate dragon who is greater than
even the gods in terms of attack points.

55:59.660 --> 56:03.010
Here goes! Ultimate Burst!

56:11.680 --> 56:14.140
Magician's Valkyria!

56:17.180 --> 56:22.480
I'm sure of it now. Whenever my life points
decrease, I myself am dealt damage...

56:22.480 --> 56:27.150
This is a Shadow Duel
controlled by forces of darkness...

56:27.150 --> 56:31.070
Yugi's life is being reduced along with his life points.

56:31.070 --> 56:32.740
This is a Shadow Game.

56:32.740 --> 56:36.450
A Shadow Game? If this duel
continues on like this, those two will...

56:36.450 --> 56:37.130
Mm-hm.

56:37.290 --> 56:40.370
Why is Big Brother playing some Shadow Game?

56:40.620 --> 56:45.380
Big brother said he he gained a card
to surpass the gods from Pegasus.

56:45.590 --> 56:49.310
That's why he said he'd duel for the title of Duel King.

56:50.380 --> 56:51.800
It looks like they've scattered.

56:51.800 --> 56:54.100
What were those things?!

56:57.760 --> 56:59.440
Yugi's over there too!

56:59.810 --> 57:04.690
The duel is still going on, but there's
something wrong with my other self.

57:05.100 --> 57:06.860
Hey, this is something else.

57:07.650 --> 57:11.740
Both the rightside-up and the
upside-down pyramids collided!

57:11.740 --> 57:15.820
When Kaiba used the Pyramid of Light card...

57:15.820 --> 57:19.580
we got sucked into that red eye and ended up here.

57:19.580 --> 57:20.700
Sucked in?

57:20.700 --> 57:24.330
Some shining walls popped up
and surrounded the duel ring.

57:24.330 --> 57:27.590
And something similar to that red eye was on it.

57:27.590 --> 57:28.800
I knew it...

57:29.750 --> 57:35.130
I had a vision where I was fighting Kaiba
in front of the mummy at the museum...

57:35.130 --> 57:39.140
Kaiba won the duel,
but someone grabbed him,

57:39.140 --> 57:43.690
and then I heard a prophecy saying: "When enough light is fulfilled, the King of Darkness will be revived."

57:43.690 --> 57:45.690
Enough light... fulfilled?

57:45.690 --> 57:48.060
That reminds me, there was a brilliant light earlier.

57:48.310 --> 57:51.190
That duel there is the Shadow
Game that was in the prophecy.

57:51.190 --> 57:52.490
What do you mean?

57:52.490 --> 57:58.670
As things stand, my other self's life is in jeopardy and we might not be able to return to our world.

57:58.670 --> 57:59.080
What?!

58:04.000 --> 58:06.290
What's that light?

58:06.290 --> 58:08.880
That's probably my other self's life points.

58:17.180 --> 58:21.100
It was flowing into the sarcophagus
in that room from before.

58:21.100 --> 58:25.230
Okay, then. In any case, let's try going to that altar room.

58:25.230 --> 58:28.280
But, the mummies were in that room...

58:30.860 --> 58:35.620
Kaiba must be taking damage
when his life points decrease.

58:35.990 --> 58:39.570
You have to be feeling some unusual pain!

58:39.570 --> 58:41.450
That's because this is a Shadow Game!

58:41.830 --> 58:43.580
Shadow Game, you say?

58:43.580 --> 58:48.420
Ever since the Pyramid of Light activated,
the field's been wrapped in an evil power.

58:48.420 --> 58:50.210
That thing's a Shadow Card!

58:50.750 --> 58:52.750
Can your accusations, Yugi!

58:52.750 --> 58:56.840
You're going off on your tales of the
occult again?! Just continue the duel!

58:57.050 --> 59:02.680
Not a single cloud of doubt on his face. Has he really not noticed any of the dark power?

59:02.680 --> 59:07.350
The guy who used Kaiba to set up this
duel just has to be somewhere...

59:07.350 --> 59:09.270
When both light and dark intersect,

59:09.270 --> 59:14.110
the King of Light will destroy the Divine Beasts of
Darkness and lay waste to the King of Darkness.

59:14.400 --> 59:15.940
When enough light is fulfilled...

59:15.940 --> 59:18.150
the King of Destruction will be reborn!

59:18.400 --> 59:20.700
The owner of that voice...

59:20.700 --> 59:26.000
It's your turn! No matter how hard you
struggle now, you're finished next turn!

59:26.000 --> 59:31.080
I only have about ten cards left.
If I take on his Virus Combo this time, I'll lose.

59:31.080 --> 59:34.960
Supposing I <i>did</i> get around his Virus Combo,
I'd still have to deal with Ultimate somehow.

59:34.960 --> 59:38.670
In despair, are we?
I won't allow you to surrender!

59:38.670 --> 59:41.970
I wish for a perfect victory!
And nothing else!

59:42.390 --> 59:48.060
You're too rash! I've always believed in
my deck right down to the last card!

59:48.060 --> 59:49.690
I'll let it all ride on this draw!

59:53.230 --> 59:54.200
Draw!

01:00:01.570 --> 01:00:03.450
Face-down card, activate!

01:00:03.830 --> 01:00:08.340
With Monster Reborn, I'll
Special Summon Dark Magician Girl!

01:00:14.590 --> 01:00:16.840
And now, face-down card, activate!

01:00:18.260 --> 01:00:19.630
Sage's Stone!

01:00:19.630 --> 01:00:26.100
This card can summon a Dark Magician when
a Dark Magician Girl is on my side of the field!

01:00:33.060 --> 01:00:33.650
It's no use.

01:00:33.650 --> 01:00:38.820
My turn's not over yet!
I offer my two Magicians as tributes!

01:00:39.360 --> 01:00:45.870
I Special Summon the Dark Magical Priest,
Sorcerer of Dark Magic!

01:00:50.830 --> 01:00:56.340
The Magical Priest's Effect will reduce
Blue-Eyes Ultimate Dragon's attack points!

01:00:57.090 --> 01:01:00.300
During battle, for each Spellcaster-Type
monster in my graveyard,

01:01:00.300 --> 01:01:05.720
it'll drop the attack points of one
opposing monster by 500 points!

01:01:06.100 --> 01:01:07.720
What?!

01:01:07.720 --> 01:01:11.680
At the moment, three Spellcaster-Type monsters
are resting in my graveyard.

01:01:12.100 --> 01:01:18.160
The sanctum of my three magicians
will reduce Ultimate's power by 1500 points!

01:01:19.940 --> 01:01:24.200
Are you saying that my Ultimate's power and your
Magical Priest's own have swapped standings?!

01:01:24.200 --> 01:01:25.700
Here we go, Kaiba!

01:01:25.700 --> 01:01:29.200
Celestial Black Burning!

01:01:37.250 --> 01:01:38.710
I end my turn.

01:01:38.710 --> 01:01:41.090
My turn...

01:01:41.090 --> 01:01:42.260
...Draw!

01:01:42.260 --> 01:01:50.890
Damn that Yugi. But, the moment he destroys the Peten left on my field, my Genocide Virus will devour his deck.

01:01:50.890 --> 01:01:52.850
That ends my turn.

01:01:53.230 --> 01:01:54.310
Draw!

01:01:54.310 --> 01:01:59.570
Sorcerer of Dark Magic's Effect will
reduce Peten's Defense Power to 0!

01:01:59.900 --> 01:02:04.950
He's attacking Peten? Ridiculous...
Isn't he afraid of Genocide Virus' effect?

01:02:04.950 --> 01:02:08.700
Let's go! Celestial Black Burning!

01:02:13.700 --> 01:02:18.830
Genocide Virus' effect activating,
Yugi, means your defeat!

01:02:20.840 --> 01:02:23.420
You've disappointed me, not two, but three times!

01:02:23.420 --> 01:02:26.180
Ten of your cards will be sent to the graveyard!

01:02:31.430 --> 01:02:32.310
What?!

01:02:32.520 --> 01:02:36.980
Sorcerer of Dark Magic is
a master-level magic priest.

01:02:36.980 --> 01:02:41.190
He can negate the activation of
trap cards and destroy them!

01:02:41.480 --> 01:02:42.950
Turn end.

01:02:43.480 --> 01:02:45.660
My... turn!

01:02:45.700 --> 01:02:48.780
Here it is... I've been waiting for this moment.

01:02:48.780 --> 01:02:53.750
I activate Monster Reborn!
Be reborn, Ultimate Dragon!

01:02:54.410 --> 01:02:58.500
Next, I offer Ultimate as a tribute
to Special Summon from my hand!

01:02:58.870 --> 01:02:59.830
What?!

01:02:59.830 --> 01:03:04.380
Ultimate Dragon is the mightiest
monster in Kaiba's deck.

01:03:04.380 --> 01:03:06.880
Is he saying there's a monster
that surpasses it, or something?!

01:03:07.260 --> 01:03:11.550
My shining dragon, decimator of all, which can
only be summoned through my ultimate monster!

01:03:11.550 --> 01:03:12.760
Appear for me!

01:03:13.010 --> 01:03:15.980
Blue-Eyes Shining Dragon!

01:03:34.740 --> 01:03:35.830
What's that?!

01:03:36.250 --> 01:03:38.010
Is that my big brother's monster?

01:03:39.920 --> 01:03:42.340
This is Blue-Eyes' final evolutionary form!

01:03:42.710 --> 01:03:44.840
Final evolutionary form?

01:03:44.840 --> 01:03:49.090
But, my Sorcerer of Dark Magic
has the higher attack points!

01:03:49.470 --> 01:03:57.020
Blue-Eyes Shining Dragon gains 300 attack points for each Dragon in my graveyard!

01:03:57.020 --> 01:04:01.690
There are five Dragons in my graveyard,
so its attack points go up by 1500!

01:04:02.060 --> 01:04:06.610
Blue-Eyes Shining Dragon's
attack points have risen to 4500!

01:04:08.070 --> 01:04:14.250
But, due to Sorcerer of Dark Magic's Effect,
its attack points decrease by 1500!

01:04:15.490 --> 01:04:16.910
No good, Yugi!

01:04:16.910 --> 01:04:19.370
Shining Flare!

01:04:22.380 --> 01:04:24.380
What?! What happened?!

01:04:24.380 --> 01:04:31.880
The player is allowed to choose whether it should be affected or not by any spell, trap, or monster effect.

01:04:32.890 --> 01:04:38.020
See that? This Blue-Eyes Shining
Dragon symbolizes my strength!

01:04:38.020 --> 01:04:41.230
All those in my way will be completely destroyed!

01:04:41.600 --> 01:04:43.520
Take this! Shining Burst!

01:05:13.380 --> 01:05:14.690
Partner...

01:05:25.020 --> 01:05:25.980
Yugi, he's...!

01:05:25.980 --> 01:05:27.360
Hang in there, Yugi!

01:06:02.020 --> 01:06:03.140
Quick, hurry up!

01:06:03.520 --> 01:06:04.780
Pegasus!

01:06:17.990 --> 01:06:20.330
Pegasus, why are you here?

01:06:20.330 --> 01:06:27.830
We must halt this duel immediately. Kaiba-boy carried off two cards in our ante rule duel.

01:06:27.830 --> 01:06:31.750
However, the only card that
I created was the Shining Dragon.

01:06:31.750 --> 01:06:37.640
The other is an evil card created by forces of darkness. It is not one of my cards.

01:06:39.180 --> 01:06:43.610
This Pyramid of Light is the embodiment
of the very nightmare I had.

01:06:44.520 --> 01:06:46.890
So, it was just how I thought.

01:06:47.190 --> 01:06:52.980
How are we supposed to stop them? Our voices
won't even reach the inside of this pyramid.

01:07:05.540 --> 01:07:06.880
Is that...?!

01:07:13.480 --> 01:07:14.340
What's wrong, Yugi?

01:07:14.340 --> 01:07:17.840
I don't know. But, all of the sudden,
the strength just left my body...

01:07:19.840 --> 01:07:22.980
There's a lot of that same light from earlier.

01:07:23.310 --> 01:07:27.810
The other me probably doesn't
have as many life points left.

01:07:27.810 --> 01:07:29.480
Hey, just hang on.

01:07:29.480 --> 01:07:30.980
Are you okay, Yugi?

01:07:30.980 --> 01:07:32.200
Thanks.

01:07:59.050 --> 01:08:03.220
Now by engulfing the King of Light, the
King of Destruction shall be reborn.

01:08:03.220 --> 01:08:07.690
And then, I shall send that detestable
Pharaoh completely to his grave!

01:08:09.560 --> 01:08:13.650
That light from before was being
sucked into the pyramid on that altar.

01:08:13.650 --> 01:08:15.770
That thing sucks the life out of people.

01:08:15.770 --> 01:08:18.030
It's the source of all the dark power?

01:08:18.030 --> 01:08:21.280
All righty. Then, all we have to
do is bust that thing up, right?

01:08:31.540 --> 01:08:33.760
Scratch that. There's mummies everywhere!

01:08:34.340 --> 01:08:38.050
May all three of you become
tributes to this dark ritual as well.

01:08:38.050 --> 01:08:40.140
That voice is the one from before!

01:08:40.840 --> 01:08:44.650
The moment both Light and
Dark collide, light grows full...

01:08:47.510 --> 01:08:52.900
And then, by engulfing the King of Light,
the King of Destruction shall be reborn.

01:08:59.230 --> 01:09:02.250
You must perish, Dark Pharaoh!

01:09:03.410 --> 01:09:07.620
The King of Destruction shall descend
forth with the ultimate light...

01:09:07.620 --> 01:09:10.750
and shall fill this world with the light of destruction!

01:09:10.750 --> 01:09:15.750
My other self will never lose!
He wouldn't just welcome the King of Destruction!

01:09:16.130 --> 01:09:21.760
This duel is a ritual between the Pharaohs of Light and Dark in order to resurrect the King of Destruction.

01:09:21.760 --> 01:09:26.890
The King of Destruction shall eliminate the dark,
eliminate all impure, and eliminate all filth!

01:09:26.890 --> 01:09:31.480
Vessel of the Pharaoh,
you stand but mere dirt in the presence of the light.

01:09:31.480 --> 01:09:34.850
You and the Dark Pharaoh
shall be consigned to oblivion!

01:09:35.690 --> 01:09:36.690
Yugi?

01:09:36.690 --> 01:09:37.730
What's wrong?

01:09:37.730 --> 01:09:43.200
I'll handle the Pyramid of Light. But, Jonouchi,
Honda, you guys go back to where we were before.

01:09:48.740 --> 01:09:52.450
I'm sure that red eye is connected
with the outside world.

01:09:52.450 --> 01:09:54.500
I think you can get out of here through there.

01:09:54.500 --> 01:09:55.870
What are you talking about, Yugi?

01:09:55.870 --> 01:10:00.420
This is connected to my other self's lost past.

01:10:00.420 --> 01:10:02.510
I can't drag you all into it.

01:10:02.510 --> 01:10:04.470
Stop messing around, Yugi!

01:10:04.760 --> 01:10:06.180
Jonouchi...

01:10:06.180 --> 01:10:09.430
What you can see,
but can't see. That's a puzzle.

01:10:09.430 --> 01:10:13.640
But, it's more than that.
I said that it's the bonds of our friendship too!

01:10:13.640 --> 01:10:14.480
He's right.

01:10:14.480 --> 01:10:18.980
But... But, I can't drag my friends into this...

01:10:21.530 --> 01:10:22.780
Yugi...

01:10:23.150 --> 01:10:23.990
Anzu!

01:10:23.990 --> 01:10:25.330
Anzu!

01:10:34.410 --> 01:10:36.170
Anzu-girl!

01:10:41.960 --> 01:10:43.670
Yugi...

01:11:10.320 --> 01:11:13.130
Yugi!

01:11:16.250 --> 01:11:20.000
You have to stop dueling right now! This is a Shadow Game!

01:11:20.210 --> 01:11:21.750
What the?

01:11:22.090 --> 01:11:23.550
Anzu...

01:11:27.760 --> 01:11:30.480
Yugi, Jonouchi, Honda...

01:11:30.480 --> 01:11:31.090
Anzu...

01:11:32.930 --> 01:11:36.930
You guys remember, right? The ring of
friendship the four of us all made?

01:11:36.930 --> 01:11:38.890
Sure do. As if we'd ever forget!

01:11:38.890 --> 01:11:41.360
We're all linked together by an invisible bond, right?

01:11:41.360 --> 01:11:42.200
Yugi!

01:11:42.200 --> 01:11:42.730
Yugi!

01:11:43.230 --> 01:11:44.730
Yugi.

01:11:47.990 --> 01:11:49.120
You guys...

01:11:53.330 --> 01:11:54.240
That's right, Yugi.

01:11:54.240 --> 01:11:57.200
We've always been linked together
by the bonds of friendship.

01:11:57.580 --> 01:12:00.120
What can be seen yet has never been seen before.

01:12:00.120 --> 01:12:03.090
Right now, we can see it just fine! Our ring of friendship!

01:12:03.460 --> 01:12:06.210
Yeah, we'll always be together!

01:12:10.220 --> 01:12:18.280
This Pyramid card wasn't created by Pegasus!
Someone used Kaiba to set this Shadow Game up!

01:12:22.020 --> 01:12:23.070
Yugi...

01:12:24.770 --> 01:12:27.160
Please, you have to hurry, Yugi!

01:12:27.690 --> 01:12:28.530
Anzu!

01:12:29.990 --> 01:12:34.160
The ritual between Light and
Dark can no longer be stopped.

01:12:34.530 --> 01:12:39.410
The Pyramid of Light cannot be destroyed
until it fills this world with light!

01:12:45.500 --> 01:12:46.930
Anzu!

01:12:50.260 --> 01:12:51.310
- Anzu!
- Anzu!

01:12:51.310 --> 01:12:51.760
Watch out!

01:12:54.760 --> 01:12:56.730
No!

01:12:56.970 --> 01:12:57.760
Incredible...

01:12:57.760 --> 01:12:59.480
That's an aspiring dance for you...

01:12:59.480 --> 01:13:00.020
Anzu...

01:13:03.980 --> 01:13:06.820
Gross! A head! A head! A-A-A hand!

01:13:06.820 --> 01:13:07.990
Let's move it, Honda!

01:13:07.990 --> 01:13:08.610
Got it!

01:13:11.820 --> 01:13:14.210
Anzu!

01:13:17.580 --> 01:13:18.710
Let's go!

01:13:22.960 --> 01:13:24.000
Honda!

01:13:24.000 --> 01:13:26.010
W-What's with this thing?!

01:13:26.540 --> 01:13:28.920
Watch out, you guys! These things are immortal!

01:13:28.920 --> 01:13:30.260
Say what?!

01:13:32.590 --> 01:13:34.590
What in the hell do we do, then?!

01:13:41.850 --> 01:13:43.030
Dammit!

01:13:44.520 --> 01:13:49.940
My servants, make their graves in a world of darkness!

01:13:50.190 --> 01:13:54.250
I was right! We have to do deal
with the pyramid on the altar!

01:13:58.160 --> 01:14:01.450
My other self! Kaiba!

01:14:01.450 --> 01:14:03.460
My turn is over.

01:14:03.830 --> 01:14:05.620
Don't look forward to a next turn.

01:14:05.620 --> 01:14:10.140
You'll lose by being unable to battle.
If you don't continue dueling, that is.

01:14:10.920 --> 01:14:15.300
You have to stop dueling right now! This is a Shadow Game!

01:14:17.220 --> 01:14:22.350
Everyone... l understand...
Everyone is lending me their strength!

01:14:22.350 --> 01:14:29.110
I won't lose... for my partner, who put
his faith in me... and for his friends...

01:14:29.860 --> 01:14:33.820
Kaiba, you heard what Anzu said too, didn't you?!

01:14:34.490 --> 01:14:36.200
Get on with the duel, Yugi!

01:14:36.200 --> 01:14:39.320
I don't intend on dealing with your
tales of Shadow Games and whatnot!

01:14:39.830 --> 01:14:41.030
I have no choice...

01:14:41.030 --> 01:14:42.950
My turn! Draw!

01:14:43.660 --> 01:14:47.300
I summon Big Shield Gardna in defense position!

01:14:51.210 --> 01:14:52.050
Turn end.

01:14:52.420 --> 01:14:56.970
No matter what card it is, it's
helpless before my Shining Dragon.

01:14:57.260 --> 01:14:59.220
My turn! Draw!

01:14:59.550 --> 01:15:05.480
It's finally here. With this card, I'll surmount the God
Cards and stand atop the apex of duel monsters!

01:15:05.770 --> 01:15:07.390
I set a face-down card.

01:15:07.390 --> 01:15:09.440
My duel has been completed!

01:15:11.190 --> 01:15:15.030
This will be my perfect victory and your perfect defeat!

01:15:15.030 --> 01:15:20.870
Here I go! Blue-Eyes Shining Dragon,
get rid of that eyesore of a Barrier monster!

01:15:29.460 --> 01:15:31.470
Shining Burst!

01:15:46.390 --> 01:15:50.850
You're safe. But how long do you intend to
keep running away with defensive monsters?

01:15:50.850 --> 01:15:52.270
Your resistance is futile.

01:15:52.520 --> 01:15:56.940
I told you, Kaiba. Told you that I
never give up until the very last card.

01:15:57.320 --> 01:15:59.450
A pathetic sight! Such a pathetic sight!

01:15:59.450 --> 01:16:03.370
I've never been so embarrassed with myself in my life!

01:16:03.370 --> 01:16:09.250
To think I recognized the likes of you as a rival!
It makes my blood boil over with rage!

01:16:09.750 --> 01:16:10.800
Turn end!

01:16:12.290 --> 01:16:14.290
It's my turn! Draw!

01:16:16.090 --> 01:16:19.420
Pot of Greed's effect lets me draw two cards!

01:16:24.350 --> 01:16:27.020
I Special Summon Watapon in defense position!

01:16:27.020 --> 01:16:32.400
It can be Special Summoned when moved from
the deck to the hand outside of a normal draw.

01:16:32.400 --> 01:16:35.710
Next, I summon Retrained Elf Swordsman!

01:16:35.710 --> 01:16:37.030
I end my turn.

01:16:37.030 --> 01:16:41.790
You imbecile... Go ahead and piece together your
wall of smallfry monsters all you like, Yugi.

01:16:41.790 --> 01:16:44.490
Your next turn is going to be your last.

01:16:44.490 --> 01:16:45.870
Kaiba, listen to me!

01:16:46.240 --> 01:16:47.370
What now?

01:16:47.370 --> 01:16:52.500
The Pyramid of Light isn't a card that Pegasus made, but the fruits of a wicked power!

01:16:52.500 --> 01:16:56.140
A true duelist would know what he must do!

01:17:02.050 --> 01:17:10.230
This duel is being controlled by evil forces out to put an end to not only my life, but to yours... No, to everything.

01:17:10.230 --> 01:17:12.640
You're being used!

01:17:16.110 --> 01:17:19.530
Brother, stop the duel!
Go back to the big brother I used to know!

01:17:19.900 --> 01:17:21.650
Please understand, Kaiba!

01:17:23.660 --> 01:17:24.780
Seto Kaiba!

01:17:24.780 --> 01:17:25.280
What?

01:17:25.280 --> 01:17:28.120
Thou art befit to be the King of Light.

01:17:28.120 --> 01:17:30.410
Send the Dark Pharaoh to his grave.

01:17:30.410 --> 01:17:35.800
Do so, and thou shall be able to
put everything into thy possession!

01:17:36.290 --> 01:17:39.170
We had a bit of an interruption,
but let's get on with the duel, Yugi.

01:17:39.550 --> 01:17:44.130
Even a duelist of your skills
cannot fight off the dark power?

01:17:44.130 --> 01:17:46.800
Have you been put in those forces' clutches?

01:17:46.800 --> 01:17:49.430
Silence! It's my turn! Draw!

01:17:54.440 --> 01:17:58.320
Card of Demise, the
Hand-Reinforcement Card I used,

01:17:58.320 --> 01:18:01.190
sends my entire hand to the graveyard after five turns.

01:18:01.190 --> 01:18:04.150
But all I just sent to the graveyard is my Spear Dragon.

01:18:04.570 --> 01:18:09.910
An overwhelming victory...
It will be proof that Seto Kaiba is the Duel King...

01:18:09.910 --> 01:18:12.160
A Dragon-Type monster to the graveyard...

01:18:12.160 --> 01:18:17.460
Blue-Eyes Shining Dragon's Attack
Power increases by another 300 points.

01:18:17.460 --> 01:18:21.420
The Pyramid of Light is a Shadow Card
from a dark power, he says?

01:18:21.460 --> 01:18:26.310
I'm being used by a dark power?
There's no way I'd believe that!

01:18:26.430 --> 01:18:30.640
Blue-Eyes Shining Dragon's
final special ability activates!

01:18:30.640 --> 01:18:34.270
What?! It still has more special
abilities hidden up its sleeves?!

01:18:34.640 --> 01:18:39.560
I'm absolutely not being used by anyone,
much less, by some dark forces!

01:18:39.560 --> 01:18:44.330
Right...After all, there's no such
thing as dark forces in this world.

01:18:45.150 --> 01:18:48.450
Yes, that's right... I've already
scored myself a perfect victory.

01:18:48.450 --> 01:18:49.460
Nevertheless!

01:18:50.280 --> 01:18:51.410
Shining Nova!

01:18:52.910 --> 01:18:57.380
Blue-Eyes Shining Dragon's last Ability, Shining Nova!

01:18:57.790 --> 01:19:03.220
An absolute destruction ability where
it tributes itself to destroy any card!

01:19:03.340 --> 01:19:05.970
Yes, Seto Kaiba! Fight!

01:19:05.970 --> 01:19:09.840
Should you best the Dark Pharaoh,
thy desires shall all come true.

01:19:09.840 --> 01:19:10.800
This again?

01:19:10.800 --> 01:19:14.270
Now! Defeat the Dark Pharaoh
and become the King of Light!

01:19:14.270 --> 01:19:17.770
All you must do is say to yourself
that you will become King!

01:19:18.140 --> 01:19:19.400
Silence!

01:19:20.150 --> 01:19:25.530
I don't believe in your occult tales
of me being controlled by dark forces, or whatever!

01:19:26.860 --> 01:19:30.870
Yugi, I'm ending this lousy duel right now!

01:19:30.870 --> 01:19:33.910
Pyramid of Light, be gone!

01:19:56.980 --> 01:19:59.730
What?! The Pyramid of Light wasn't destroyed!

01:19:59.730 --> 01:20:00.520
Why not?

01:20:00.520 --> 01:20:06.110
I put my efforts into making you the King of Light...
But, you were but a mere child, in the end, I see.

01:20:06.110 --> 01:20:09.360
What are you babbling about?!
Who in the hell are you?!

01:20:09.360 --> 01:20:11.030
My name is Anubis!

01:20:11.030 --> 01:20:13.490
I will destroy the King of Darkness
to become the King of Destruction!

01:20:13.870 --> 01:20:17.370
What was that? Where are you?! Show yourself!

01:20:17.700 --> 01:20:19.330
Kaiba, behind you!

01:20:26.500 --> 01:20:28.210
Kaiba!

01:20:35.220 --> 01:20:36.400
Kaiba!

01:20:40.600 --> 01:20:44.060
I was hoping to see you, Dark Pharaoh...

01:20:50.070 --> 01:20:53.910
Are you the one that used Kaiba to set up this duel?!

01:20:53.910 --> 01:20:56.700
And why are you referring to
me as "Dark Pharaoh?!"

01:20:56.700 --> 01:21:00.130
I must expunge the spirit of the King of Darkness...

01:21:00.460 --> 01:21:05.840
Now is the time I send thee to thy doom by my own
hands, and usher in destruction upon this world.

01:21:06.250 --> 01:21:09.800
Dark Pharaoh, begone with thy vessel!

01:21:10.170 --> 01:21:11.720
Vessel?

01:21:11.720 --> 01:21:15.050
There is only death for souls
that step foot in the labyrinth!

01:21:17.810 --> 01:21:17.810
Partner!

01:21:20.520 --> 01:21:23.600
This has nothing to do with
matters of the past anymore...

01:21:23.600 --> 01:21:24.440
What?

01:21:24.440 --> 01:21:27.940
I'll fight for my partner... and my rival!

01:21:27.940 --> 01:21:32.990
I won't let you get away for hurting
these duelist's noble souls!

01:21:37.990 --> 01:21:42.420
Thou shall be judged in this Pyramid
of Light, Dark Pharaoh!

01:21:42.830 --> 01:21:45.210
Our hallowed duel cannot be stopped!

01:21:45.210 --> 01:21:47.960
When the Pyramid of Light has been activated,

01:21:47.960 --> 01:21:52.970
my Divine Beasts of Judgment are summoned
by means of my secret hieratic text!

01:22:00.770 --> 01:22:02.230
What's this?!

01:22:24.710 --> 01:22:28.500
Come forth! Andro Sphinx! Sphinx Teleia!

01:22:57.070 --> 01:23:02.330
Retrained Elf Swordsman is a monster
that's not destroyed by battle with monsters

01:23:02.330 --> 01:23:04.300
with an attack points of 1900 or more!

01:23:07.830 --> 01:23:12.550
Sphinx Teleia, consign that inferior
monster to its doom with your wisdom!

01:23:12.550 --> 01:23:14.220
Question of the Trial!

01:23:22.430 --> 01:23:24.140
A monster effect?!

01:23:24.140 --> 01:23:27.150
Andro Sphinx! Sphinx Roar! Over there!

01:23:33.270 --> 01:23:38.820
Andro Sphinx deals damage
equal to half your destroyed servant's attack points.

01:23:38.820 --> 01:23:41.780
This would be quite the trite
affair if you were to fall so easily.

01:23:44.830 --> 01:23:45.330
Yugi!

01:23:45.330 --> 01:23:46.790
Yugi!

01:23:46.790 --> 01:23:49.670
Struggle, Dark Pharaoh!

01:23:50.040 --> 01:23:54.550
The more you struggle, the more
the light will grow in luster!

01:23:55.050 --> 01:23:57.840
On my next turn, you will receive
the judgment of the light.

01:23:57.840 --> 01:23:59.980
Let terror strike you, Dark Pharaoh!

01:24:01.050 --> 01:24:03.930
This really is the very last card...

01:24:03.930 --> 01:24:07.560
My turn! Last card, draw!

01:24:07.810 --> 01:24:10.900
Two cards— and they're Double
Spell along with Exchange...

01:24:20.530 --> 01:24:22.410
Why, you! Get the heck off me!

01:24:23.990 --> 01:24:25.330
Really freakin' gross!

01:24:27.500 --> 01:24:30.210
Honda! Jonouchi! Anzu!

01:24:30.210 --> 01:24:32.300
Yugi, we're all right! Hurry up!

01:24:33.710 --> 01:24:37.300
You can do it! Don't give up, my other self!

01:24:39.340 --> 01:24:42.260
I can break that. I just need something solid...

01:24:43.300 --> 01:24:47.270
Yugi! Hurry! We can't last much longer!

01:24:49.230 --> 01:24:50.770
Empty!

01:24:50.770 --> 01:24:53.200
Need something solid... Need something solid...

01:24:56.520 --> 01:24:57.910
Guys...

01:24:59.940 --> 01:25:01.290
I've got to try!

01:25:01.650 --> 01:25:03.240
Hit the mark!

01:25:17.840 --> 01:25:19.300
What's this?

01:25:21.720 --> 01:25:23.840
You guys did it!

01:25:23.840 --> 01:25:25.470
I activate Double Spell!

01:25:25.850 --> 01:25:32.190
I discard a card to select a card from my
opponent's graveyard and use it as my own card!

01:25:42.950 --> 01:25:46.160
Spell card, Monster Reborn!

01:25:46.530 --> 01:25:49.080
Be reborn, Blue-Eyes Shining Dragon!

01:25:55.120 --> 01:25:59.300
Your Pyramid has already lost its light!

01:26:00.130 --> 01:26:01.590
Shining Nova!

01:26:02.050 --> 01:26:06.640
Be gone, Pyramid! Away with you, Sphinxes!

01:26:14.600 --> 01:26:16.600
T-This cannot be!

01:26:36.580 --> 01:26:38.790
Jonouchi, Honda, Anzu!

01:26:38.790 --> 01:26:40.140
Ah! So, they've all come to!

01:27:07.910 --> 01:27:08.950
The Pyramid of Light...!

01:27:08.950 --> 01:27:10.710
Yugi! Where's Yugi?!

01:27:14.910 --> 01:27:19.500
Now your Pyramid of Light has collapsed
and the omen has been broken.

01:27:19.500 --> 01:27:24.050
Dark Pharaoh... Why
do you have so much power?!

01:27:26.260 --> 01:27:29.550
My partner and our friends helped me out.

01:27:29.550 --> 01:27:34.770
What good could you do now that you've
lost your servant?! This ritual is not yet over!

01:27:34.770 --> 01:27:38.320
Come forth! Sphinx Androgynous!

01:27:51.410 --> 01:27:55.040
All monsters wandering between both Light and Dark!

01:27:55.040 --> 01:27:59.010
Bestow upon Sphinx Androgynous your strengths!

01:28:10.130 --> 01:28:11.720
H-Hey, look!

01:28:11.720 --> 01:28:13.640
Huh? Its attack points...!

01:28:13.640 --> 01:28:14.890
35000?!

01:28:15.260 --> 01:28:17.230
Away with you, Dark Pharaoh!

01:28:21.600 --> 01:28:26.900
My mightiest servant, Sphinx Androgenous, is the
leader of all monsters, a servant under the gods!

01:28:26.900 --> 01:28:29.030
You will succumb before this monster...

01:28:29.030 --> 01:28:32.320
The bested is he who has lost all of his monsters!

01:28:32.320 --> 01:28:34.620
We'll see about that.

01:28:34.620 --> 01:28:39.370
I have a card on my field and you have the
card that Kaiba left behind placed face-down.

01:28:39.750 --> 01:28:45.630
If my hunch is correct, Kaiba's card is
one to gain control of the three gods!

01:28:47.260 --> 01:28:48.920
Reverse of Reverse!

01:28:49.220 --> 01:28:54.760
When this is the only card on my field, I can activate an opponent's face-down card as if it was my own!

01:28:54.760 --> 01:28:57.820
And that is... Return from the Different Dimension!

01:29:01.100 --> 01:29:02.990
Gods, descend forth!

01:29:13.110 --> 01:29:13.960
What?!

01:29:18.870 --> 01:29:20.750
Experience the wrath of the gods!

01:29:20.750 --> 01:29:23.340
Hyper God Energy!

01:29:41.850 --> 01:29:46.280
Ultimate Iron-Blow! Infinity God Impact!

01:30:18.220 --> 01:30:19.310
He did it!

01:30:19.310 --> 01:30:20.470
Yugi won!

01:30:20.470 --> 01:30:21.720
Yugi!

01:30:33.320 --> 01:30:34.820
My other self...

01:30:34.820 --> 01:30:35.660
Partner...

01:30:43.910 --> 01:30:45.260
Kaiba...

01:30:48.380 --> 01:30:49.590
Are you okay?

01:30:50.210 --> 01:30:50.210
Yugi...

01:30:51.130 --> 01:30:53.710
I don't need your help...

01:30:53.710 --> 01:30:55.270
Big brother.

01:30:58.010 --> 01:30:59.800
Kaiba! Your left arm!

01:30:59.800 --> 01:31:01.650
Shut up. It's nothing.

01:31:15.110 --> 01:31:16.650
What?!

01:31:16.650 --> 01:31:17.860
What is this?

01:31:31.380 --> 01:31:32.000
Could that...

01:31:32.000 --> 01:31:32.750
...thing be...

01:31:32.750 --> 01:31:33.880
Anubis?

01:31:33.880 --> 01:31:39.520
My name is Anubis.
Watcher of the Dead and King of the Underworld!

01:31:44.720 --> 01:31:46.020
Unbelievable...

01:31:46.020 --> 01:31:46.890
He's...!

01:31:46.890 --> 01:31:49.400
Is this Anubis's true form?

01:31:49.400 --> 01:31:55.780
I shall slaughter both the Dark Pharaoh and the King of Light and become the King of Destruction!

01:32:14.170 --> 01:32:16.710
Die a miserable death, Pharaoh!

01:32:17.090 --> 01:32:18.390
Yugi! Watch out!

01:32:20.380 --> 01:32:24.350
Go! Gilford the Lightning! Gearfried!

01:32:24.970 --> 01:32:28.860
What impertinence! Stay in your place, you curs!

01:32:35.570 --> 01:32:38.690
Ignorant fools who have sworn
their allegiance to the King of Darkness!

01:32:39.070 --> 01:32:41.330
May you realize your own stupidity!

01:32:59.300 --> 01:33:01.430
Come now. Outside, before it's too late!

01:33:01.430 --> 01:33:04.260
My Toon monsters will not hold much longer.

01:33:04.720 --> 01:33:07.260
Yugi, don't you dare lose to him!

01:33:07.260 --> 01:33:09.980
We're always with one another!

01:33:09.980 --> 01:33:10.860
Yeah!

01:33:14.690 --> 01:33:15.570
Come now, hurry up!

01:33:26.450 --> 01:33:31.800
Those nuisances are all gone. Have you prepared
to accept your fate, Dark Pharaoh?!

01:33:37.420 --> 01:33:40.920
Dark Pharaoh! Allow me to present
you my utmost gratitude, as well...

01:33:40.920 --> 01:33:43.760
I will use all my strength to send thee to thy grave!

01:33:43.760 --> 01:33:44.940
Accept your fate!

01:33:50.810 --> 01:33:51.980
Yugi!

01:33:53.310 --> 01:33:54.400
Kaiba!

01:33:57.150 --> 01:34:00.690
You're the one who should accept
his fate, King of Destruction!

01:34:05.570 --> 01:34:08.830
Appear now! Blue-Eyes Shining Dragon!

01:34:21.010 --> 01:34:22.890
Shining Nova!

01:35:48.260 --> 01:35:50.760
What in the world was that?

01:35:51.300 --> 01:35:55.980
An Ancient Egyptian mystery. All of it has been
sealed, along with its darkness, once more.

01:35:55.980 --> 01:35:57.770
That's right.

01:35:57.770 --> 01:36:04.280
The best card that I've made
burned itself up to save us all...

01:36:04.650 --> 01:36:06.610
Albeit unwillingly...

01:36:06.610 --> 01:36:07.860
Brother.

01:36:08.240 --> 01:36:09.200
Kaiba.

01:36:13.080 --> 01:36:15.830
Dark powers... I don't believe in those things...

01:36:15.830 --> 01:36:19.290
I'm going to surpass you with my own power.

01:36:19.290 --> 01:36:22.880
Your defeat will decorate my road of glory.

01:36:23.250 --> 01:36:25.880
Kaiba, you really are a True duelist.

01:36:26.260 --> 01:36:30.590
And you are the true Duel King, again, Yugi.

01:36:30.970 --> 01:36:32.510
I'm going to be the one to defeat you.

01:36:32.510 --> 01:36:34.470
Big brother!

01:36:35.180 --> 01:36:41.310
I might have gotten you all wrapped up in a lot of
trouble due to giving you the Millennium Puzzle.

01:36:41.690 --> 01:36:43.400
What are you saying, Grandpa?

01:36:43.400 --> 01:36:48.370
Thanks to the Millennium Puzzle, I
was able to make so many friends!

01:36:48.900 --> 01:36:50.120
Jonouchi...

01:36:50.650 --> 01:36:51.660
Honda...

01:36:52.450 --> 01:36:53.120
Anzu...

01:36:54.200 --> 01:36:55.210
And...

01:36:56.700 --> 01:36:58.700
Other self...

01:36:58.700 --> 01:37:00.590
You sure did, Partner.

